    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Ad Account Users API",
      "Anchor": "ad-account-users-api",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "The Ad Account Users API enables advertisers to manage ad account user access. Ad account users are members who have ad account permissions in Campaign Manager. Partners can manage user roles to more precisely control access.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Permissions",
      "Anchor": "permissions",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Permissions"
      ],
      "Text": "There are two conditions for successful Ad Account Users API calls:",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Permissions",
      "Anchor": "permissions",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Permissions"
      ],
      "Text": "Scope permission accessibility for:\n\nrw_ads (read/write)\n\nr_ads (read-only)\n\nThe Ad Account user assigning permission holding one of the following Ad Account roles:\n\nACCOUNT_BILLING_ADMIN\nACCOUNT_MANAGER\nCAMPAIGN_MANAGER\nCREATIVE_MANAGER\nVIEWER (read-only, even with rw_ads scope)",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Ad Account User Role Definitions",
      "Anchor": "ad-account-user-role-definitions",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Ad Account User Role Definitions"
      ],
      "Text": "The following table describes in detail what each role provides:",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "table",
      "Section": "Ad Account User Role Definitions",
      "Anchor": "ad-account-user-role-definitions",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Ad Account User Role Definitions"
      ],
      "Text": "",
      "Headers": [
        "Control Name",
        "Description"
      ],
      "Rows": [
        [
          {
            "Text": "VIEWER",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          },
          {
            "Text": "View campaign data and reports for the account. No ability to create or edit campaigns or ads.",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "Text": "CREATIVE_MANAGER",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          },
          {
            "Text": "View campaign data and reports for the account. Ability to create and edit ads.",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "Text": "CAMPAIGN_MANAGER",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          },
          {
            "Text": "View campaign data and reports for the account. Ability to create and edit campaigns and ads.",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "Text": "ACCOUNT_MANAGER",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          },
          {
            "Text": "View campaign data and reports for the account. Ability to create and edit campaigns and ads. Edit account data and manage user access for the account.",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "Text": "ACCOUNT_BILLING_ADMIN",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          },
          {
            "Text": "View campaign data and reports for the account. Ability to create and edit campaigns and ads. Edit account data and manage user access for the account. Can also access billing data and is billed for this account.",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Ad Account User Role Definitions",
      "Anchor": "ad-account-user-role-definitions",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Ad Account User Role Definitions"
      ],
